sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant PD as Processes Dashboard
    participant PBM as Process Builder Modal
    participant API as Backend API
    participant PS as Process Service
    participant VS as Version Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant AS as Activity Service

    Note over U, PD: User managing existing processes
    U->>PD: Access processes dashboard
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes
    API->>PS: Fetch all processes
    PS->>API: Return process list
    API->>PD: Process data
    PD->>U: Display processes table
    
    Note over U, PD: Edit process workflow
    U->>PD: Click "Edit" on "Weekly Newsletter Campaign"
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes/{id}/edit-lock
    API->>PS: Check if process is being edited
    PS->>API: Process available for editing
    API->>PD: Edit lock acquired
    PD->>PBM: Open Process Builder Modal (edit mode)
    
    PBM->>API: GET /api/processes/{id}/configuration
    API->>PS: Fetch process configuration
    PS->>API: Return process details
    API->>PBM: Process configuration data
    PBM->>U: Pre-populate form with existing data
    PBM->>U: Show "Editing: Weekly Newsletter Campaign"
    
    U->>PBM: Modify process description
    U->>PBM: Add new integration "HubSpot"
    U->>PBM: Change priority from "Medium" to "High"
    
    U->>PBM: Click "Update Process"
    PBM->>VS: POST /api/processes/{id}/create-version
    VS->>DB: Save current version as backup
    DB->>VS: Version saved
    VS->>PBM: Version created
    
    PBM->>API: PUT /api/processes/{id}
    API->>PS: Update process configuration
    PS->>DB: Save updated process
    DB->>PS: Update confirmed
    PS->>API: Process updated
    API->>AS: Log process modification
    AS->>API: Activity logged
    API->>PBM: Update successful
    
    PBM->>PD: Close modal, refresh dashboard
    PD->>U: Show updated process with "Modified" indicator
    
    Note over U, PD: Duplicate process workflow
    U->>PD: Click "Duplicate" on "Social Media Automation"
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes/{id}/duplicate
    API->>PS: Fetch source process
    PS->>API: Return process configuration
    API->>PBM: Open Process Builder with duplicated data
    PBM->>U: Show "Create New Process (Copy)"
    PBM->>U: Pre-fill form with copied data
    PBM->>U: Append " (Copy)" to process name
    
    U->>PBM: Modify name to "Q1 Social Media Campaign"
    U->>PBM: Update department to "Marketing"
    U->>PBM: Keep existing integrations
    
    U->>PBM: Click "Create Process"
    PBM->>API: POST /api/processes/create
    API->>PS: Create new process
    PS->>DB: Save new process
    DB->>PS: Process created with new ID
    PS->>API: New process created
    API->>AS: Log process duplication
    AS->>API: Activity logged
    API->>PBM: Creation successful
    
    PBM->>PD: Close modal, refresh dashboard
    PD->>U: Show new duplicated process in table
    
    Note over U, PD: View process details workflow
    U->>PD: Click "View" on "Content Creation Workflow"
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes/{id}/details
    API->>PS: Fetch process details
    PS->>API: Return comprehensive process data
    API->>PD: Process details
    PD->>U: Open process details modal
    
    PD->>U: Display process information
    PD->>U: Show assigned worker type
    PD->>U: Show configured integrations
    PD->>U: Show usage statistics
    PD->>U: Show performance metrics
    PD->>U: Show recent activity history
    
    Note over U, PD: Process status management
    U->>PD: Click status toggle for "Blog Generation Process"
    PD->>API: PUT /api/processes/{id}/status
    API->>PS: Toggle process status
    PS->>DB: Update status (Active → Paused)
    DB->>PS: Status updated
    PS->>API: Status change confirmed
    API->>AS: Log status change
    AS->>API: Activity logged
    API->>PD: Status updated
    PD->>U: Update status badge to "Paused"
    
    Note over U, PD: Bulk process operations
    U->>PD: Select multiple processes
    U->>PD: Click "Bulk Actions" dropdown
    PD->>U: Show bulk action options
    U->>PD: Select "Archive Selected"
    PD->>U: Show confirmation dialog
    U->>PD: Confirm bulk archive
    
    PD->>API: POST /api/processes/bulk-archive
    API->>PS: Archive multiple processes
    
    loop For each selected process
        PS->>DB: Update status to "Archived"
        PS->>AS: Log archive action
    end
    
    PS->>API: Bulk archive completed
    API->>PD: Bulk operation successful
    PD->>U: Remove archived processes from table
    PD->>U: Show "3 processes archived" notification
    
    Note over U, PD: Process version history
    U->>PD: Click "History" on edited process
    PD->>VS: GET /api/processes/{id}/versions
    VS->>PD: Return version history
    PD->>U: Show version history modal
    PD->>U: Display version list with timestamps
    
    U->>PD: Click "View Version 2"
    PD->>VS: GET /api/processes/{id}/versions/{version}
    VS->>PD: Return version details
    PD->>U: Show version comparison
    PD->>U: Highlight changes from previous version
    
    U->>PD: Click "Restore This Version"
    PD->>U: Show confirmation dialog
    U->>PD: Confirm version restore
    PD->>VS: POST /api/processes/{id}/restore-version
    VS->>PS: Restore to selected version
    PS->>DB: Update process configuration
    DB->>PS: Restore completed
    PS->>AS: Log version restore
    AS->>VS: Activity logged
    VS->>PD: Version restored
    PD->>U: Show "Process restored to version 2" 